  "details": "The dolly is already very nice for streaming, but an automatic photo option would be very good too. :)\n\n1) Allowing to trigger xx photos at a specific interval of time along a dedicated photo path.\n\n2) And/or have an additonnal option in each path \"point\" to be able to pause for s seconds to trigger n photos\n\n+ SteamVR key binding to trigger the path.\n\nIt could be used for different use cases: \n\n- automatic selfie mode : taking photos at different distances , angles and heights with the push of one button. \n\n(compared to the many boring steps required currently for positionning then triggering the photos, which break immersion completly \n\ninstead of having a full automated mode that would allow you to keep going / having fun / dancing, while the photo path simply gets trigerred and does its job :)\n\n- group photo mode: same take multiple angles and panning\n\n- world multi photo to grab the ambiance at different points of the world regularly\n\n...",
